      "LanguageDll.12672": "Вiдповiдач (код\u00A0— %((A:TRANSPONDER1 CODE, BCO16) sp0)%(l0 12 >> 15 &)%!d!%(l0 8 >> 15 &)%!d!%(l0 4 >> 15 &)%!d!%(l0 15 &)%!d!)",
